      "id": "yc-infra",
      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/industry/infrastructure",
      "mode": "crawl",
      "limit": 80,
      "prompt": "From this Y Combinator company directory or batch listing, extract startups whose PRIMARY product is an AI agent sandbox, secure code execution for LLM/coding agents, browser or computer-use isolation, ephemeral dev environments for agents, or MCP-hosted untrusted code. For each company: official product name, canonical website (company domain — not ycombinator.com/companies/... unless no public site yet), offering_type, availability, launch_stage. Skip generic B2B SaaS, observability-only, pure LLM APIs without isolation, and devtools unrelated to sandboxes. Include infra that clearly markets microVM/WASM/container isolation for agent workloads."
    },
